[{"id":3208608100,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6_P3lk","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?u=e44a465cbebabb9ea2be80b59e6dc07966bef5b7&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","login":"clayjohn","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn"},"body":"This fully disregards the input value and in doing so removes the entire reason for this macro to exist. \n\nThe macro exists just to suppress \"unused variable\" warnings. This change makes the value unused again, so the macro does nothing. \n\nIf this is showing up in an profiler, then we need to figure out a different trick. Perhaps you can copy what we do in the ERR_PRINT functions that allows us to avoid evaluating the arguments?","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110402#pullrequestreview-3208608100","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110402","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-09-11T03:55:17Z"},{"id":3211494879,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6_a4Xf","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"66018bebdd898ec7c55f2dc494bd3a5ea215efab","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally on several demos that contain binary `.res` files, it works as expected. Code looks good to me.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110402#pullrequestreview-3211494879","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110402","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-09-11T13:13:00Z"},{"id":5238203392,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABODikAA","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"90917b22747366e623d128ad26c6e7b7e77778ff","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","login":"Ivorforce","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce"},"body":"This is code from `GODOT IS OPEN SOURCE`. It's bizarre that we've kept this debug code nobody's using around for long enough that it's creating real problems in a profiler.\n\nLet's get rid of it.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110402#pullrequestreview-5238203392","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110402","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-09-17T15:46:24Z"},{"id":5238920841,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOEOWiQ","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"66792239b059d73a5703633f5ee6f359929a67d5","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?u=4a42fd867f2c449fcc23adf635dd574dae98e6c2&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","login":"akien-mga","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga"},"body":"I agree we should get